 "descripcion": "Nora got in the car. It drove deeper into the forest. She jumped, ran, and woke up 300 miles from home. Her last forum post is dated three days later.\n\nWould you have jumped?\n\nNarrated fiction. New part every day.\n#horror #horrorstories #scarystories #survival #creepypasta",
