 "lineas": [
  {
   "texto": "Part three. Nora is so tired that she *gets in the car*.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "The kind man locks the doors with a soft click.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "He drives away from the lights, deeper into the forest.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "She asks where town is. He doesn't answer.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "In the mirror, his smile hasn't moved for ten minutes.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "The drums are louder now, right outside the windows.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Her battery dies at the exact moment the forum says: *jump*.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Stay, because what happened next is why she never rides at night again.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Nora pulls the handle. The lock gives. She throws herself out.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "She rolls into the ferns and runs, without looking back.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Behind her, the car stops. Doors open. *Many* doors.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "She runs until the trees end and her feet hit real asphalt.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Sunrise. A gas station. A trucker gives her coffee.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "She is in Nevada, *three hundred miles* from home.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "When her phone charges, she opens the forum thread.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Her last post is there. Dated three days from now.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "And this morning her phone vibrated: Hollow Pines, *next stop*.",
   "pausa": 0.8
  },
  {
   "texto": "If your bus stops talking, get off early.",
   "pausa": 0.3
  }
